                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15d63273-5eea-399b-a9e6-8eab7b4f8eb6",
                        "entry_id": "6802ac8c-1925-3515-a4c8-0d2640de1d2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. людоедство; поедание людьми человеческой плоти"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b39f0a78-3fe7-4640-939e-d86c0aac91ce",
                                "sense_id": "15d63273-5eea-399b-a9e6-8eab7b4f8eb6",
                                "text": "О, пройдут еще века бесчинства свободного ума, их науки и антропофагии, потому что, начав возводить свою Вавилонскую башню без нас, они кончат антропофагией. Но тогда-то и приползет к нам зверь и будет лизать ноги наши и обрызжет их кровавыми слезами из глаз своих."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08825ff7-6a44-45a7-9391-53d72567633c",
                        "source_entry_id": "6802ac8c-1925-3515-a4c8-0d2640de1d2e",
                        "source_sense_id": "15d63273-5eea-399b-a9e6-8eab7b4f8eb6",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthropophagy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthropophagy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e718c911-5581-3859-a832-eee2a64e906b",
                                        "entry_id": "e0611fa8-8933-3ea3-a2e1-6a5519562ff1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act or practice of eating human flesh, especially in the context of human cannibalism"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58aa0601-0d24-4206-9e6c-f6104a2bec15",
                                                "sense_id": "e718c911-5581-3859-a832-eee2a64e906b",
                                                "text": "Other paraphilias are more blatantly transgressive and usually illegal: amokoscisia (desire to slash or mutilate females); anthropophagy (cannibalism); anthropophagolagnia (rape accompanied by cannibalism); […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "087404ae-5c4e-425e-81f4-562d7304b00a",
                        "source_entry_id": "6802ac8c-1925-3515-a4c8-0d2640de1d2e",
                        "source_sense_id": "15d63273-5eea-399b-a9e6-8eab7b4f8eb6",
                        "target_lang_word": "cannibalism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cannibalism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07a3a239-98f1-3ddb-b6e2-2bcf70062681",
                                        "entry_id": "ff0f4111-6b82-342b-9f3a-83abf70c936e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of eating another of one's own species."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be433d47-c3a7-4fc1-ab52-6f53d4b89dfc",
                                                "sense_id": "07a3a239-98f1-3ddb-b6e2-2bcf70062681",
                                                "text": "Cannibalism does not openly figure amongst aboriginal misdeeds, but in the northern part of Queensland it is no uncommon vice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52664153-3d20-4034-aad3-a72ccf6ed5a6",
                                                "sense_id": "07a3a239-98f1-3ddb-b6e2-2bcf70062681",
                                                "text": "Evidence for cannibalism abounds - even if circumstantial - both from the modern world and throughout history, but academic anthropology has found itself in a funk of denial. […] Considered globally, cannibalism should be less a moral issue than one of custom. I like Marmite, but then I have been raised on the stuff."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bc44fd6-c4d6-4cad-9b17-34b7ddb53b7d",
                                                "sense_id": "07a3a239-98f1-3ddb-b6e2-2bcf70062681",
                                                "text": "HuFu and was promoting it as “the healthy human flesh alternative!” Mark Nuckols, inventor of HuFu, says, “I have to admit that I myself have never sampled human flesh. . . . However, I've done quite a bit of research on the history and anthropology of cannibalism and read enough accounts to have come up with a fairly good approximation”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3eb6087-3ad8-36bb-9f7e-209668b4e137",
                                        "entry_id": "ff0f4111-6b82-342b-9f3a-83abf70c936e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act in which one thing consumes or takes over another of the same kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce3d3dd5-0c48-3ab1-b79b-865de428123b",
                                        "entry_id": "ff0f4111-6b82-342b-9f3a-83abf70c936e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In speech, the occurrence of one word eliding part or all of the next word, because the syllables are the same."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
